  "description": "The OXVA XLIM 4 pod vape kit delivers highly customisable mouth-to-lung and restricted direct-to-lung vaping in a remarkably slim and portable design. Powered by a substantial 1600mAh built-in battery, this device provides reliable all-day performance while 2A fast charging minimises downtime. Designed for vapers who want precise control without complex menus, the XLIM 4 offers a maximum 30W output and features the innovative Super Pulse System to ensure consistently clear flavour from the first draw to the last. Operating the XLIM 4 is effortlessly straightforward thanks to its 3-Level Power adjustment. A simple double-click allows you to cycle between low, medium, and high output settings to perfectly match your preferred flavour intensity and vapour production. Monitoring your device is equally intuitive, with a multifunction LED ring light that provides instant visual feedback on battery life and power modes, alongside customisable glow effects. A precise vertical airflow control slider also lets you fine-tune your inhale from a tight, cigarette-like draw to a looser, airy vape. This kit introduces the upgraded 2ml XLIM Top Fill Cartridge equipped with UNITECH 3.0 technology. These pods feature enhanced leak-resistant construction and a rapid 30-second priming time, keeping your daily maintenance clean and efficient. The pre-installed 0.8ohm mesh pod is perfectly suited for 50/50 freebase e-liquids or Nicotine Salts, delivering an exceptionally smooth throat hit and rich taste. Fully compatible with the wider OXVA XLIM pod family, the XLIM 4 is a highly versatile and dependable choice for everyday vaping.",
